# The Dockerfile is read by Linux tools: docker, semgrep and trivy. A Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf gave it CRLF, and semgrep's Dockerfile parser then
# failed partway through. Locally the scan came out clean while GitHub, reading
# LF, failed it on every run (docs/24-m7-closure.md §10.5). LF everywhere, as
# deploy/local-staging/.gitattributes already does for scripts run in Linux
# containers.
backend/Dockerfile text eol=lf
